## Tool Selection Logic

The agent decides which tool to use based on the task type, context, and available information. This is not random — it follows patterns based on task semantics.

### Decision Matrix

| Task Type | Primary Tool | Secondary Tools | Why |
|-----------|-------------|-----------------|-----|
| **Read specific content** | `Read` | `Grep`, `Glob` | Exact content needed |
| **Find files by name** | `Glob` | `Grep`, `Shell` | File pattern matching |
| **Search code content** | `Grep` | `Read`, `SemanticSearch` | Text pattern matching |
| **Semantic search** | `SemanticSearch` | `Grep` | Meaning-based, not text-match |
| **Execute command** | `Shell` | `Task` | System-level operations |
| **Create/overwrite file** | `Write` | `StrReplace` | New file or complete replacement |
| **Edit specific lines** | `StrReplace` | `EditNotebook` | Targeted in-place modification |
| **Complex multi-step task** | `Task` (subagent) | `Shell`, `Read` | Parallel or isolated work |
| **Code review** | `Read`, `Grep` | `SemanticSearch` | Comprehensive understanding |
| **Debugging** | `Shell`, `Read` | `Grep` | Run code, inspect output |

### Tool Selection Factors

The agent considers these factors when choosing tools:

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[User Request] --> B{Task characteristics}
    
    B --> C[Need to find file?]
    C -->|By name| D[Use Glob]
    C -->|By content pattern| E[Use Grep]
    C -->|By meaning/semantics| F[Use SemanticSearch]
    
    B --> G[Need to read content?]
    G -->|Specific file+location| H[Use Read]
    G -->|File content search| E
    
    B --> I[Need to modify?]
    I -->|Whole file| J[Use Write]
    I -->|Specific text| K[Use StrReplace]
    I -->|Jupyter cell| L[Use EditNotebook]
    
    B --> M[Need to execute?]
    M -->|Simple command| N[Use Shell]
    M -->|Complex task| O[Use Task subagent]
    
    D --> P[Execute tool]
    E --> P
    F --> P
    H --> P
    J --> P
    K --> P
    L --> P
    N --> P
    O --> P
```

### Context-Aware Tool Selection

| Context Factor | Tool Preference | Example |
|---------------|----------------|---------|
| **Large codebase** | `Grep` over `Read` | Search for pattern instead of reading entire file |
| **Specific function needed** | `SemanticSearch` over `Grep` | Find "login validation" not just "login" text |
| **Build/test operation** | `Shell` over manual | Run `npm test` instead of reading test output |
| **Multi-file refactor** | `Task` subagent over sequential | Parallel subagent for each module |
| **Quick edit** | `StrReplace` over `Write` | Change 3 lines in existing file |

