## Context-Aware Tool Selection Examples

### When to Use Each Search Tool

| Scenario | Recommended Tool | Reason |
|----------|-----------------|--------|
| Find all `UserService` references | `Grep` | Exact text match |
| Find authentication-related code | `SemanticSearch` | Meaning-based, not text |
| Find all test files | `Glob` | File pattern matching |
| Read a specific function | `@code` reference | Surgical precision |
| Read entire file | `Read` + `@file` | Complete context |
| Find "error handling" patterns | `SemanticSearch` → `Grep` | Semantic first, text second |

### Agent Decision Flow for Code Understanding

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["User: Find error handling"] --> B{Specific text known?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Grep exact pattern]
    B -->|No| D{File location known?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Read file + @file ref]
    D -->|No| F{Meaning-based search?}
    F -->|Yes| G[SemanticSearch]
    F -->|No| H[Grep with broad pattern]
```

